Alembic owns every database change. Revision `20260904_0001` installs the
approved relational baseline and required catalogs. Its immutable SQL artifacts
live under `alembic/sql`; SQLAlchemy metadata is assembled from feature models
through `app.db.models`.

Use `alembic upgrade head` to apply changes and `alembic check` to detect drift.
Do not run the SQL artifacts manually against a developer database.
